      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COLLINDA RAMSAY (4) comes off an average effort last start when fifth at this track over 425m behind Starlord Bale (24.70) in a Grade 5. Scored at his previous run. Looks the one to beat on his best form. WHERE'S HUNTLY (7) scored a most impressive win two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 8 length 5th at this track (24.65). Cannot be underestimated. HIGH COTTON (8) drawn the outside box and could get a clear run. Was below best last time when 6th and beaten 4.5 lengths at Healesville (20.12). Goes very well at course and distance boasting one wins. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings 10 times from 18 attempts. Should be about the mark. HARD STYLE ROBBO (2) is one of the chances after a minor prize when favourite last time.",
